{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Tower Defence Game Where YOU Are the Invader</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <i>Tokyo\u2019s Neon Monsters</i>, you play as an adorable giant kaiju micromanaging  resources as you struggle to defend your Neon Queen \u2014 a colossal cosmic entity who demolishes buildings, feeds on toxic waste, and births armies of needy baby monsters that defend your captured territory against hordes of angry humans. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395090/extras/dragoon_expanding_WIDE.gif?t=1744712112\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Completely destructible Neon City</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Monster evolutions</strong> that enhance your defence strategically</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Wide variety of rogue-like upgrades.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Hordes of Human Resistance</strong> featuring different types and characteristics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Stylized Voxel Art</strong> &amp; Neon Glow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395090/extras/Summon_bomb_wide_gif.gif?t=1744712112\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Wishlist Now &amp; Join the Invasion!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready to unleash the Neon Queen and her monstrous army. Wishlist now on Steam and join our Discord to be part of the development journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395090/extras/Office_Panic_v05.png?t=1744712112\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3395090?t=1744712112","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackgro